  "instructions": [
    "in a mortar, pound the parsley, dill, and mint together with a pestle until well combined.",
    "in a large saucepan, heat the sesame seed oil over medium heat.",
    "add the bulgur to the saucepan and toast, stirring constantly, for 2-3 minutes, or until lightly browned.",
    "add the salt, black pepper, and lemon juice to the saucepan, stirring to combine.",
    "add the water to the saucepan and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 10 minutes, or until the bulgur is tender and the liquid has been absorbed.",
    "fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
